{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca3bb7f3db04896228c366b5bd254df6359fe7bcf8530b2f4cbf575591d4efb",
      "text": "那么在拍摄之前，请先试玩一下吧。\n这台就是本次即将推出的游戏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:155d471109fc34022582aa9ca6f2e869f28e205c41c9044a275f089f7f2e6454",
      "text": "哇，设计好帅气啊。\n……啊。你们两个，快听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a27ddf5503b3306419e1d52bcc38bfb9458b9fb9c3ad3d518a6ed16d9d61b5e",
      "text": "嗯？……哦哦，正在放俺们的歌呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8484a1a5d7d821e066fb3506ad5748e91a6055033d49c350dc306a4cd5e09fa7",
      "text": "…像这样亲耳听到之后，切实地感受到了\n我们的歌曲真的被实装进去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470b3ba33a4029248e0d73096ccd753b24f615c903c4548a10f25c8517678fce",
      "text": "试玩的时间已经留充足了，\n请尽情体验吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b46127727891f53d8775e0238bef64ae618a180329d3506102d689e22b5b9d0",
      "text": "……呼。顺利通关了呢，一希先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:004552586fdf6630bdb25795fa5df8f8dedb867e10467bf056beb4f4f03258af",
      "text": "…嗯。两个人的连击接续上之后，得分就\n涨上去了呢。这就是“合作游玩”的力量吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5173618a0fefbf87ca8a3b06499978088fd1f04b49f4d71a3eca7f224d074cf1",
      "text": "让我看看，凉和老师的得分是……\n喔，“S级”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f99306660f04c5f1635a400d744b04ca6136b317a279a7c3e7a4755492906fa7",
      "text": "太棒了♪ 因为是我们自己的歌，\n点击音符的节奏很容易掌握呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1df035f13b8793b4a0f6c3ec6e935e9cacc81d6620f06a2ec47fad88b1818bd",
      "text": "下一个轮到俺了！刚才看着感觉，\n稍微把难度提高一点也没问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfced6e51e025c5bebfefea0e424cfd65c4003183aa44a0fac3d2a401747c317",
      "text": "既然这样难得有机会，\n要不要挑战一下最高难度看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:510613d302820adabd0b73fabb3a71e853a93bc0006e4e6f15ac6f90e1c84c85",
      "text": "嚯，最高难度吗……好，那就去挑战试试看！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
